      }
    },
    "During the festival, a child named Lia wandered into the forest, chasing a fluttering lantern. As night fell, her path home grew dark and menacing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Během festivalu mladá dívka jménem Lia zabloudila do lesa, pronásledovala plápolající lampion. Když se setmělo, její cesta domů se stala temnou a hrozivou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Email"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email Not Verified" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nepotvrzený email"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ember, now seen in a new light, began to interact more with the villagers. He helped farmers by clearing large rocks and occasionally showered the village with gentle rains for their crops." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ember, nyní viděn v novém světle, začal více interagovat s vesničany. Pomáhal farmářům odstraňovat velké kameny a občas poléval vesnici jemným deštěm pro jejich plodiny."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ember's Contributions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Emberovy příspěvky"
          }
        }
