    "Number of members: %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Počet členů: %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One evening, as the village prepared for an annual festival, whispers of Ember's terror spread, fearing he would burn the village down. Unknown to them, Ember watched from afar, sad to be misunderstood." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jednoho večera, když se vesnice připravovala na roční festival, se šířily šeptandy o Emberově teroru, s obavami, že spálí vesnici. Ember z dálky sledoval, smutný z toho, že je nepochopen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Oops! Failed to load the board :(" : {
