        }
      }
    },
    "Other" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ostatní"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Over time, Ember wasn't just accepted; he was loved. Festivals now included an extra celebration for the dragon, and Ember, once a feared beast, became the village’s most cherished guardian." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "S časem byl Ember nejen přijat; byl milován. Festivaly nyní zahrnovaly dodatečnou oslavu pro draka, a Ember, kdysi obávaná bestie, se stal nejvíce ceněným strážcem vesnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Overnight, Tilly became an internet sensation as divers captured her predicament, turning her into a meme across social networks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Přes noc se Tilly stala internetovou senzací, když potápěči zachytili její situaci a proměnili ji v meme na sociálních sítích."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heslo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password are not the same" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hesla nejsou stejná"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password Changed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heslo bylo změněno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password must be at least 8 characters long, contain at least one digit and at least one upper case character" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Heslo musí mít alespoň 8 znaků, jednu číslici a jedno velké písmeno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password Reset Failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chyba při obnově hesla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zastavit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petal and Fang decided to experiment with their diets, leading to a mix-up that saw Fang blooming unusually bright, and Petal accidentally trapping a confused ant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Petal a Fang se rozhodli experimentovat se svými dietami, což vedlo k záměně, při které Fang neobvykle jasně rozkvetl a Petal omylem chytila zmateného mravence."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petal tried to convince Fang to try a diet of dew and sunlight, leading to humorous attempts at swapping diets for a day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Petal se snažila přesvědčit Fanga, aby vyzkoušel stravu z rosy a slunečního svitu, což vedlo k humorným pokusům o výměnu diet na jeden den."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Petal, ever peaceful, stretched towards the sun, while Fang snapped at passing flies, causing a commotion among the garden dwellers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Petal, vždy mírumilovná, se natáhla ke slunci, zatímco Fang kousal do létajících much, čímž způsobil rozruch mezi obyvateli zahrady."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plain Timer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pomodoro Timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please, check your inbox and verify the address using a link which was sent to your email!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prosím, potvrďte Vaši emailovou adresu pomocí odkazu zaslaného do Vaší emailové schránky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please, fill in your email and we will attempt to send you a password reset link" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Prosím, vyplňte svou emailovou adresu a my se Vám pokusíme zaslat email s odkazem na obnovení hesla"
