          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap here to create a new guild" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vytvořte nový cech"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to start a classic pomodoro timer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Spusťte klasický Pomodoro timer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Experiment" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Experiment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The experiment brought them closer, teaching each the value of the other's lifestyle, and they planned a garden feast that welcomed all creatures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Experiment je sblížil, oba se naučili cenit si životního stylu toho druhého, a naplánovali zahradní hostinu, která přivítala všechny bytosti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Festival of Fears" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Festival obav"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The garden erupted in laughter at Fang’s beetle bonnet, and even Fang had to chuckle, seeing his reflection in a dewdrop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zahrada se rozchechtala nad Fangovou broučí čepicí a dokonce i Fang se musel zasmát, když uviděl svůj odraz v kapce rosy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The garden thrived as Petal and Fang, with their unique quirks, proved that diversity is the garden’s true strength, celebrating their differences with every bloom." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zahrada prosperovala, protože Petal a Fang se svými jedinečnými vlastnostmi dokázali, že rozmanitost je opravdovou silou zahrady, a oslavovali své rozdíly s každým květem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local sea creatures, realizing the impact of their actions, began offering gifts of natural beauty to Tilly, like coral pieces and colorful stones." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Místní mořské bytosti, uvědomující si dopad svých činů, začaly Tilly nabízet dary přírodní krásy, jako jsou kousky korálů a barevné kameny."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Message Emerges" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vzkaz se objevuje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Misunderstood Guardian" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nepochopený strážce"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Return of the Good Dragon" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Návrat dobrého draka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Unintended Ornament" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nevolný ozdobný předmět"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Vegetarian's Dilemma" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vegetariánovo dilema"
          }
        }
