          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This user has already been invited to the guild. Tell them to check their pending invtitations, please." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento uživatel již obdržel pozvánku do tohoto cechu. Tuto pozvánku může přijmout v záložce Cechy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This user is already a member of the guild." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tento uživatel je již členem tohoto cechu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilly the turtle was happily swimming through her reef when a plastic bottle top, a remnant of human carelessness, lodged itself comically in her nose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Želva Tilly spokojeně plavala svým útesem, když se jí v nose komicky zasekl vršek plastové lahve, pozůstatek lidské nedbalosti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilly, once a comedic meme, became a symbol of resilience and a beloved figure in the fight against ocean pollution." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tilly, kdysi komický meme, se stala symbolem odolnosti a milovanou postavou v boji proti znečištění oceánů."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilly's Contributions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillyiny příspěvky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilly's Triumph" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillyho triumf"
          }
        }
      }
